{"timestamp": "2025-10-27T15:46:44.555886", "function_name": "make_arrow", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a fresh episode.\n  env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  # Cycle through movement actions: DOWN, UP, LEFT, RIGHT (indices 0\u20113).\n  move_cycle = [0, 1, 2, 3]\n  move_idx = 0\n  # Keep interacting until the task is reported as done or we hit a safety limit.\n  while not env._is_done() and len(actions) < 2000:\n      # Try to use (collect/craft) whatever is directly in front of the agent.\n      actions.append(4)          # USE action\n      env.step(4)\n      if env._is_done():\n          break\n      # If not done, take a movement step following the simple cyclic pattern.\n      act = move_cycle[move_idx % len(move_cycle)]\n      move_idx += 1\n      actions.append(act)\n      env.step(act)\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": -1}}
